WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:05.230
How long are you guys going to take
to confirm a few obvious facts?

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.360
Or are you just trying to protect her?

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:13.410
What obvious facts are you talking about?
It's your word against hers.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:17.080
I don't want to hear words
uttered from an inferior race.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:23.880
Spreading irresponsible nonsense,
and damaging the reputation of my sect.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.510
Whether it's nonsense or not
has not yet been decided.

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:32.720
So in other words, you just want to protect her?

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:40.390
It's not everything in full detail,
there are some private things left out.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:43.550
But that's mostly how it went.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:46.060
If what you're saying is true,

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:52.650
the words on this Truth Paper
are enough to convince us,

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:56.920
but it holds no weight for people outside the sect.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.330
Guess we'll have to ask the Chief to decide.

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:02.000
Let's solve this with some brute force.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:09.320
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:39.450
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:46.150
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:49.670
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:56.830
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:02.540
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:06.890
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:12.830
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:17.160
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:20.200
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.380
whose name we've yet to know

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:36.630
Chief,

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:41.770
a recount of all events has been
written on this Truth Paper.

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:43.490
Show it to Master Shiho.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:52.190
So you're just going to cover for her after all?

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.580
Cover?

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:58.650
Obu didn't do anything wrong.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:04.910
Or are you actually aware that there's a need
for us to protect her from your unjust accusation.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.370
This is only your made up side of the story!

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:18.380
Indeed, but your slanderous accusation
is also nothing but your side of the story.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:23.970
Or do you have any solid proof?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.810
<i>Proof? Are you kidding me?</i>

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:30.770
<i>An authoritative figure of the Seikyo Sect, the leader
of the Mansen Sect Alliance is not enough proof?</i>

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:35.810
<i>With that name-tag, I should be
able to hide anything I want.</i>

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:44.910
<i>Even from another member of the Mansen
Sect Alliance, like the Reiken Sect. </i>

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:51.410
<i>Puppeteering a fake sect in the White
Moon Country, meddling in its politics,</i>

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:56.040
<i>deceiving regular people with Composite Spirit Bases...</i>

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:59.590
<i>It was all for my research on
the Essence and Blood Boiling Techniques.</i>

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:05.910
<i>I can't help but feel threatened as I watch
my disciples make impressive progress,</i>

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:14.640
<i>while I myself feel stuck at
the 4th tier of Nascent Soul.</i>

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:20.720
<i>Am I gonna just sit here and watch
my subordinates slowly taking my place?</i>

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:27.310
<i>Even though I tried, it seems like
this is as far as I can come.</i>

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:31.950
<i>But, there is that research on the Composite Spirit Base.</i>

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:41.460
<i>If I can make that work, there's no way
anyone will be able to threaten me anymore.</i>

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:44.970
<i>I was so close before that woman showed up.</i>

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:50.850
<i>If the Seikyo sect finds out what I've done,</i>

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:55.230
<i>I'll be guilty of tarnishing the name
of the sect, and be severely punished.</i>

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:58.560
<i>I'll have to bury this whole thing.</i>

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:03.360
You didn't even take a look at it,
yet acted like you already know everything.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.530
It's obvious you all planned
this together, behind my back.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.410
There's simply no need.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:11.950
That paper is not for me, but for you.

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:15.870
I believed whatever Obu said from the very start,

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:21.300
and so did every other elder
of the Heavenly Sword Hall.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:25.040
Well said, Chief.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:28.050
Regardless of her unbearable personality,
I can wholeheartedly trust her in this matter.

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.480
I agree.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:31.810
Me too, even though I think she has issues.

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:36.740
Everyone here knows we have a sour relationship,

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:40.030
but I still can trust her on this.

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:42.270
Don't you agree, Elder Hokaku?

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.440
I do.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:50.280
You guys are ready to take on the Seikyo Sect
as an enemy? Just for one elder at the JinDan Stage?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:57.220
Master Shiho, that's exactly what I want to ask you.

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:03.920
Do you really believe the Seikyo Sect would take
the Reiken Sect as an enemy for only one disciple,

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:07.380
at the Nascent Soul Stage?

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:14.100
Such insolence, there's no way we of the Seikyo Sect—

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:16.680
You're so funny.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.050
How old are you?

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:22.940
Seikyo Sect this, Seikyo Sect that.
Having lived for hundreds of years,

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:25.440
you still can't say something of your own accord?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:26.320
What?

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:31.320
I heard your conversation.
Thanks everyone for believing in me.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.600
Especially Elder Hokaku.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:37.870
I bet your conscience must've suffered
when you forced yourself to say that.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:39.120
As for the problem at hand,

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:43.630
do you plan to live behind
the shadow of your sect forever?

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:48.750
This issue is between you and me,

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:52.090
so how about we solve it with a duel, one-on-one?

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:56.020
The losing side gives up on all their claims.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:02.480
She's only at the JinDan Stage,
one whole stage below me.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:06.400
<i>With the Heart Oath before the duel,
it'd be impossible to cheat.</i>

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.940
<i>Why is she suggesting this?</i>

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:11.740
Or are you too scared?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.950
Don't be kidding yourself!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:16.660
That's...

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.630
Such divine gear! Rikuri,
gimme a rough estimation!

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:25.960
Kozan Sword, a tier 8 divine item.

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:29.050
It'd be worth about 800k at
the Genten Hall of the Sokei Region,

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:32.680
and around 600k in the Chu Region.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:36.970
That's nice, very nice.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:47.430
<i>He transformed the space so fast?</i>

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:50.520
<i>But that can only be done after the Fusion Stage.</i>

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:56.620
<i>Is he really only at the Semi-Deity Stage?</i>

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:05.400
We're at the heart of the Reiken Sect, I only did it
with the help of the ki flowing through the mountain.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:06.540
<i>Guess I over-analyzed.</i>

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:11.550
Cloud Base, the arena intended for the highest
level of sparring in the Reiken Sect.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:20.430
The arena is able to contain within itself,
the damage done during any given fight.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.270
Check it out!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.960
Looks like a duel.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:24.940
Let's go.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:29.650
Disciples quickly gathered under the stage,

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:33.450
all eager to watch the duel between
the JinDan and the Nascent Soul.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:37.190
Forget what's been said.

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:42.780
If I lose I'll admit to whatever
you wrote on that paper.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:46.830
But if I win...

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:50.130
Okay, I'll let you do whatever to me.

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:52.510
I didn't say that!

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.510
You'll have to come back with me
to the Seikyo Sect to apologize and—

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:58.380
Let everyone at the Seikyo Sect
do as they please with me?!

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:02.640
How can an elder from one of the 5 big sects
say something so obscene, this candidly?!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:06.190
Whatever, but that's only if you can win.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:09.910
If you lose, you must admit to everything you did,

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:13.900
and give me all your divine gear.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:17.280
Alright, let's make the Heart Oath.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.070
The Heart Oath.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:23.360
An oath sworn on one's own cultivation.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:30.220
As an unwritten rule in the world of cultivation,
it means two things during a duel.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:32.200
No outside help is allowed.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.800
And no killing of an opponent.

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:40.300
Come one, come all! On one side, Master Shiho
of the Seikyo Sect at the Nascent Soul Stage.

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:45.000
On the other? Someone stuck at
the lowly JinDan Stage, my teacher Obu.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.350
Who will take it all? C'mon and place your bets!

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:53.230
The oath is set, let's begin.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:55.280
Where'd she go?

00:09:55.280 --> 00:10:00.470
Sorry, I just left to help Oriku
set up bets among the disciples.

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:02.870
I had to clarify a few things with him.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:03.740
Bets?

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.460
Does no one at the Reiken Sect
have respect for a proper duel?

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:10.420
What a bunch of clowns.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:24.260
He changed the stage into soil. An amazing
tactical decision, as expected of a master.

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:27.100
Seems like he's well trained in spell casting.

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:34.980
Shiho has a Spirit Base of the soil property,
so his Kozan Sword with soil-based properties is enhanced.

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:39.740
He easily transformed the clouds into soil, and gained
a huge environmental advantage by doing so.

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:43.240
<i>How foolish of a JinDan to challenge me.</i>

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:47.500
<i>Alright then, I'll do as you wish.</i>

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:58.790
Nice Soil-Needle Spell, not only does it have great impact,
its vibrations also cause a level of effect.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:03.180
For someone at Nascent Soul, that's really well done.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:12.180
With just one touch...

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:16.190
Despite her stage, Obu successfully
defended the attack from Master Shiho?

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:19.450
She's even standing on the tip of its needle!

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:23.200
You must be weaker as an aged man.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:26.950
I'm really disappointed in the pillar you've erected.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:30.040
Show me what type of man you are, Shiho-kun.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.580
The disciples are watching, you know.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.550
Don't put the Nascent Soul to shame.

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:44.850
Is that all you've got?

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:48.030
<i>Not only can I transform cloud into soil,</i>

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:50.100
<i>I can also transform soil into metal.</i>

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.100
<i>Which is the element that can cancel out your wood!</i>

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.440
Have a taste of this KouKin Sword Skillset!

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:01.280
You're unexpectedly agile. Well done.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:06.140
Do you still want to fight without a weapon?

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:08.870
Give up, before you really get hurt.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:14.080
Don't get so giddy about destroying a wooden sword.

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:17.500
How long has it been since you've
been in a real fight, Shiho-kun?

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:22.840
<i>That's just a spell-created sword?</i>

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:28.010
<i>So she defended my soil-based spell not
with a divine item, nor any wood-based gear,  </i>

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.600
<i>but with just a normal wooden sword?</i>

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:35.460
Divine gear is unnecessary.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:38.690
Facing you with a simple wooden
sword is more than enough.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:45.700
She just couldn't afford any high level divine gear.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:51.950
<i>Is this Obu really only at the JinDan Stage?</i>

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:02.460
<i>She must have a lot of fighting experience,
she has great defensive skills.</i>

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:11.060
<i>I know how to cast spells well, but I've spent most
of my time in research. I'm not a dueling expert.</i>

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:18.730
<i>But, there's no going back. I'll cast various
spells and try to wear her down.</i>

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.190
<i>I'll show you the difference in our stages.</i>

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:27.040
Tryin' to tire me out by spewing
out a bunch of spells?

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:28.030
How stupid.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:34.200
Cows can plough themselves to death, but the more
the fields are ploughed, the more fertile they get.

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:42.870
Elder Shumei, what does she mean
about all the ploughing and stuff?

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:44.670
It's nothing you need to know.

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.170
Why?

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:49.940
You're the one who said I should just ask
whenever there's something I don't understand.

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:53.180
Stop asking or I'll make you copy out the books.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.020
But why?

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:06.540
Are you really trying? You're putting me to sleep.

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:08.820
How about this?

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:13.830
Guess that doesn't work.

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:21.580
The fight is reaching its climax,
but the bet is still on! Come on, everyone!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:22.550
Gimme one.

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:24.840
Don't push, you'll all get your turn.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.020
So that's Nascent Soul.

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:29.440
His spells that use the five elements are amazing.

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:32.950
It's said that cultivators at the Nascent Soul
Stage can destroy a mountain with ease.

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:34.600
That powerful?

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:38.250
Seems like Elder Obu is barely keeping up with him.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.570
What do you want?

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:43.210
Can't you see how busy I am? Gimme a hand.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.270
Why would I, it's not like I'm obliged to...

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:46.900
Oh, but aren't you?

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.610
One sec.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.700
Come, come! Don't lose this chance!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.830
Is that all you've got?
You really can't hold out for long, can you?

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:02.570
How is she defending against my spells so easily?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.840
You're only at the JinDan Stage!

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:12.550
Your howling isn't going
to give you any extra power.

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:34.660
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:39.710
<i>I overused my energy, and depleted my ki.</i>

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:47.960
Why? If she's not cheating, how can
someone be so strong at that stage?

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:51.680
It's not that I'm strong, it's that you're weak.

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:58.020
Sure your spells are flashy,
quite typical of a Nascent Soul.

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:01.020
But sadly, you yourself are weak.

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:03.400
Don't underestimate the Reiken Sect.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:08.530
Every elder here is far more stronger than you.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:13.410
You've forgotten about what cultivation really is in
the first place, and turned to depraved techniques.

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:16.910
No, this has nothing to do with
the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.410
It's just that I've spent all my time
on research, so I'm not a good fighter—

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:20.890
Really?

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:25.710
Where's your fighting spirit from when
you first faced me in White Moon Country?

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:30.090
If you win you're the real deal, if you lose
it's because you spent too much time on research,

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.170
isn't that too convenient?

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:37.010
Even with all the fighting experience in the world,
cultivation built on such depraved techniques is useless.

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:43.230
Which is why I destroyed your
Thousand Spirits Sect in the first place.

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:47.230
You don't understand anything at all.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:54.490
If my research succeeds, the Essence and Blood Boiling
Technique would revolutionize the cultivation world!

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:58.870
We wouldn't be bound by potential,
everyone would be able to aim for higher ground.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:05.870
The Nine Regions might even enter
another golden age of cultivation!

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.730
How does that make sense?

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.590
A revolution?

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.920
With a technique that literally
sucks the life out of someone?

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.030
There's no other way!

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:18.180
Without potential, no affinity, no resources,

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:22.160
what choice do we have, when we find
ourselves up against a wall in our cultivation?

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.800
Instead of wasting time looking around the wall,

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:31.820
why don't you use it to break through into
the next stage, and see what you can find there?!

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:35.030
What a moving speech.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:40.910
But for someone without the potential or the ability,
why would they even bother to cultivate?

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.450
Realize where you stand!

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:52.300
The world of cultivation is not a fair place.
When you reach your limit, learn to give up.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:18:00.030
That's how you cultivate. You want to see what's
ahead once you break through to the next stage?

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:01.930
But do you really feel that way?

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:05.960
The moment you turned to depraved techniques,

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:15.820
everything ahead of you in your path
of cultivation became worthless.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:25.370
Although you've made it to Nascent Soul, you seem
to have forgotten what true cultivation is in the first place.

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:32.380
I...concede.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.380
I...concede.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:37.880
Obu is the strongest JinDan of all the Nine Regions.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:40.710
She had better control of her emotions.

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:43.510
What a great display of her Ethereal Heart.

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:47.860
Whatever the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique
can give you, in the end is only skin deep.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:53.480
By trying to breakthrough with techniques like that,

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:56.530
he's already abandoned his own path of cultivation.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.150
Please take care of it.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:03.530
If I get a chance, I'll come by
and make a formal apology.

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:09.090
What "If I get a chance" really means,
is that there's no chance.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:14.150
Because of his failure here,
and the events in White Moon Country,

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:19.650
he'll be bound for one hundred years under
the Seikyo Sect's hall as punishment.

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:24.430
Which probably means a life sentence for Shiho.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:29.960
He unexpectedly got some guts.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:34.390
If I were him I'd refuse to go back,
and just ask for asylum in the Reiken Sect.

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:37.570
Didn't expect you'd be so kind.

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:43.070
As someone in the higher ranks,
he probably has lots of insider information.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:47.090
We could hold him hostage and blackmail
the Seikyo Sect for tons of money.

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:48.700
Yup. You're just the same old scumbag.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:56.140
Kosho, you're here...?

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.640
I see that you've lost.

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.340
What a disgrace.

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:03.590
What? Even though you're
a direct subordinate of Shinsei,

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:06.890
you're only at the JinDan Stage.
I don't have to listen to your crap.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:17.670
Know your place, you piece of trash.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:21.280
Are you...really only at the JinDan Stage?

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:27.360
Being at the JinDan Stage is more than
enough to deal with trash like you.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:38.320
This is...Kosho, without a sect trial you
don't have the right to do this to me.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.640
Don't make me laugh.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:55.540
It's unlikely I'll even need to get approval from
the elders to deal with something like you.

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:59.860
The proof that the Reiken Sect
had is rock solid and undeniable.

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:05.030
Go back on your own,
I'm going to tend to other matters.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:15.790
Thanks for coming again,
I'll tie up your donkey in the backyard.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.570
These are the files on the Reiken Sect?

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:24.470
Yes sir.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:25.550
So little.

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:31.410
These past few years, the ones
kicking up a fuss in the Sokei Region

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:38.600
were usually some tier 2 sects,
never the Reiken Sect.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:44.330
As one of the 5 big sects,
the Reiken have been unexpectedly quiet.

00:21:45.210 --> 00:21:51.710
Even the intelligence department of the Seikyo Sect,
was only able to gather such limited info.

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:53.750
Th-This is...

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:56.460
What's the deal with this sect?

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:00.680
Shiho, you fool.

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:03.600
You almost brought us disaster.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:23.740
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:27.210
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:29.050
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:35.070
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:40.470
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:51.320
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:57.760
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:01.490
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:04.690
oh so powerfully

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:10.250
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:15.840
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:16.100 --> 00:23:25.940
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:37.600
"The Calm Before the Storm".

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:39.430
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
